WEBVTT

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:14.070
S-Sorry.

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:16.820
No... I'm the one who should apologize.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.400
<i>Don't be fooled by appearances.</i>

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.400
<i>Inside, that's an old guy 
who's over thirty.</i>

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.290
<i>If we just interact normally, it'll be fine.</i>

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:26.010
<i>Stay calm. Just stay calm.</i>

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:29.550
<i>My body may have become female, 
but I'm a man who's into women.</i>

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:33.670
<i>I do not ever want to be in a 
romantic relationship with this guy!</i>

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>I could never fall in love with a guy!</i>

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:38.930
<i>This story is...</i>

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:42.730
<i>Well, you may have already 
guessed from their reactions.</i>

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:47.020
<i>It's a romantic comedy between an old guy 
and someone who used to be an old guy.</i>

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:06.420
Life with an Ordinary Guy who 
Reincarnated into a

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:06.420
Total Fantasy Knockout

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:18.990
Ginza      In a restaurant bathroom

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:22.620
Episode 1

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:18.990
Oh, man...

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:22.620
A Guy Who Reincarnated as a                  .
Fantasy Knockout and Another Guy           .

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:22.000
There's so many cute girls, 
it's got me nervous.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.950
Flight attendants really 
are on a different level!

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:26.070
Are they?

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:26.700
Huh?

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:29.040
I don't find them interesting at all.

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:31.400
I'm more interested in the 
fish tank. Did you see it?

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:33.960
Fish are wonderful. I get really excited.

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:36.910
Why did you come to this mixer anyway?

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:39.800
Caring even a little about your 
appearance makes you attractive.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:40.220
Ugh...

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:43.520
Get to know the women first, so that 
you're not deceived by a stranger.

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.470
Are you my mom or something?

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:49.400
<i>These two childhood friends have known
 each other since elementary school,</i>

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.010
<i>but they are not alike at all.</i>

00:02:51.230 --> 00:03:00.110
Jinguuji Tsukasa (32)

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:53.140
<i>Jinguuji Tsukasa.</i>

00:02:53.060 --> 00:03:00.110
.    Tall      .

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:55.480
<i>He's tall with handsome features.</i>

00:02:54.110 --> 00:03:00.110
Handsome features

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.580
<i>No matter what he does, he does it well.</i>

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:00.110
Excels in both athletics
and academics           .

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:00.110
<i>He excels in both athletics and academics,
 and is clever and confident.</i>

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:01.610
.                                                .
Roughly 20 Years Ago 
.                                                .

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:01.610
<i>And because of that...</i>

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:04.850
<i>he's been incredibly popular 
ever since his school days.</i>

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:04.990
<b>Middle School</b>

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:08.620
<i>Women have fallen for him continuously 
for the last 20 years now.</i>

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:08.160
<b>High School</b>

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:11.250
<b>University</b>

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:12.510
<i>He's never been particularly 
interested in women...</i>

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:15.050
<i>But as their dark sides have stood 
out to him more than anything else,</i>

00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:17.950
<i>he's developed a complete distrust of women.</i>

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:19.130
<i>And that is why...</i>

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:23.250
<i>I will only allow you to date 
a woman I've approved of.</i>

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:26.710
<i>Though I doubt that such a woman exists.</i>

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:29.140
<i>That's the excuse he gives, but...</i>

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:31.600
<i>I really do feel more comfortable around men.</i>

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:34.640
<i>The oasis of my heart is, and 
will always be, you alone.</i>

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:38.150
<i>He really just doesn't want a woman 
to take his best friend from him.</i>

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:41.950
If you don't see a girl you like, 
I wish you'd at least not get in my way.

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:45.410
Then why do you always invite me?

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.160
It's because you know 
this will happen, right?

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:51.360
I-I get nervous coming to these mixers alone.

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:53.110
You feel lonesome so easily.

00:03:53.110 --> 00:03:55.350
Why don't you have a little 
more confidence in yourself?

00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:56.910
Confidence, huh?

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:01.010
<i>That's impossible with you around!</i>

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:08.260
Tachibana Hinata (32)

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.640
<i>Tachibana Hinata.</i>

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:04.710
<i>Height, weight, etc. all average.</i>

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:08.260
Average

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:08.260
Average

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:08.260
Average

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:06.160
<i>Neither good nor bad at anything.</i>

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:08.260
<i>This man walks a finely balanced line.</i>

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:10.270
Oh! Um, excuse me!

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:15.190
<i>Every woman he has ever fallen 
for has been taken by Jinguuji.</i>

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:19.150
<i>I never imagined it would continue 
even after we left school!</i>

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:23.560
<i>As long as I'm with him, 
I'll never get a girlfriend! Ever!</i>

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:29.160
<i>The reason he brought Jinguuji to mixers was 
to get him married off as quickly as possible.</i>

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:32.190
<i>But why does this guy have 
so little interest in women?</i>

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:33.790
<i>We're already 32, you know?</i>

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:37.750
<i>Could it be that he's in love with me?</i>

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.800
<i>This situation appears very complicated.</i>

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.630
I want to be a woman.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:48.550
If I'm always going to feel this small and 
miserable, I'd rather just become a woman.

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:51.840
I want to be a girl so beautiful 
that I couldn't possibly exist

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:54.060
in this world, and have everyone fawn over me.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.560
You drank too much, idiot.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:59.010
If possible, I'd want to look childlike, 
but still be sharp.

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:01.750
A short loli-type with soft blonde hair... 
That would be great!

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:03.820
Saying things like that is why 
you can't get a woman.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:07.950
Oh, shut up! Even I would do fine if
I didn't have someone like you close by!

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:10.110
I'm tired of hearing that.

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:11.450
Out of curiosity...

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.640
What kind of girl would you like?

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:15.460
I've never given it any thought.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:18.710
Right now, all I'm thinking about 
is seeing you back to your place.

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:22.460
Why? Why is it always you, Jinguuji?

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:25.060
You're really despicable, you know that?

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:28.010
You're popular and cool. It's no fair...

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.910
Blast it. You moron...

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:37.230
And the only one who'd spend time with 
someone as despicable as me is you.

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:39.140
Come on, wake up!

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:42.610
Say... Is it dead?

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:45.780
Wha—?!

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.830
A bizarre, half-naked, LED woman!

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.320
It's a halo! A halo!

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:51.760
You're a very rude human!

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:54.830
Alive then, is he?

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:57.040
Step aside, Four-Eyes.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:01.710
If he lives, then I merely need to kill him.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.800
Tachibana!

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:07.800
Tachibana!

00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:09.580
Where are you, Tachibana?

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:13.310
You're safe. I'm so glad.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:15.060
Huh? Safe?

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:18.780
Safe from what? I can't remember.

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:21.020
Hey, wake up, Tachiba—

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:23.070
What?!

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:25.280
Your body's melted!

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:27.460
What is this? It's disgusting!

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:31.820
Oh, keep it down. You're making my head ring.

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:33.680
Is this a hangover?

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:37.580
My head hurts and I feel 
like my throat is weird...

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.190
Where are we anyway, Jinguuji?

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:41.930
Wh— Wh—

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:42.580
Huh?

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.710
Who are you, you snake?!

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:45.860
Huh?

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:47.620
What have you done with Tachibana?!

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:49.590
What? Did you hit your head or something?

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:52.410
Forgetting your best friend's 
face is pretty harsh.

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:56.920
I only have one best friend!
 And it isn't you!

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:58.600
Huh? Whoa! She's cute!

00:06:58.960 --> 00:06:59.990
Who is that?

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:00.930
You.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:03.220
What?!

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:04.570
What is this? What's going on?

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:06.780
I've got stuff I shouldn't up top!

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.780
And I'm missing stuff
I should have down below!

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:13.280
Why am I in the body of the 
perfect woman I dreamed up?!

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.380
Why are you barfing?!

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:20.560
It's like Tachibana turned into a girl 
and is talking to me. It's sickening.

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:24.310
I <i>have</i> become a girl and I <i>am</i> talking to you!

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:25.670
Do you like it?

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:29.800
How is it? What do you think of becoming 
the embodiment of your desires?

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.410
What's this? An exhibitionist 
woman has suddenly appeared.

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:35.180
Both of you are really rude!

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:37.380
Desires embodied?

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:38.310
What do you mean?

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:43.440
When I summoned you here, 
I granted you your wish.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:46.800
Welcome to another world, O brave heroes!

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:51.450
This world is on the brink of danger, and 
the only ones who can save it are heroes!

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:54.250
When you have magnificently 
defeated the Demon Lord,

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:56.950
I shall grant you any wish you like!

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:01.530
Did you hear that, Jinguuji? 
Apparently, we're heroes!

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:03.920
Do not be fooled, Tachibana-like woman.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.670
This is bound to be some kind of scam.

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:07.460
You say some really crazy things.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.320
I get a very unpleasant feel from this woman.

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:11.840
We shouldn't get involved with her.

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:14.550
<i>His memories should have been erased.</i>

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:16.600
<i>His sharp intuition is a problem.</i>

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:18.530
And most importantly...

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:21.600
turning you into a woman 
was probably her doing.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:24.270
She stole my oasis from me!

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:28.820
Humans die without water!

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:31.460
How am I supposed to live now?!

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:32.610
You're upset enough to cry?

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:36.110
So until you turn Tachibana back, 
I will not listen to you!

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:37.120
Understand?

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:41.120
You dare to give me orders?

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:43.200
That stance shows no sign of cooperating...

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:45.180
Calling me an LED display, a con artist...

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:47.310
Quit pushing your luck, Four-Eyes...

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:50.500
I am a goddess of love and beauty!

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:53.410
You lower life-forms need 
to learn your place.

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:55.760
Fine. You're only here to 
make up the numbers anyway.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:58.580
I'll go ahead and make use 
of you for some amusement.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:00.660
Rejoice!

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:04.960
For good or ill, I cast this curse which 
shall make you want to save this world!

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:11.930
Breaking the curse, returning 
everything to normal...

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:13.660
All of it is possible if 
you defeat Demon Lord!

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:15.480
So go ahead and try your best!

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:16.930
Bye-bye!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.260
What was all that?

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:22.700
Let's be logical for a moment.

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:26.620
I've been trying to make sense of the 
situation we've found ourselves in...

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:30.630
Yeah. It's been so chaotic, I've got no idea.

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:32.710
And I'm starting to get hungry.

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:35.130
What are we supposed to 
do about food and water?

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.010
Jinguuji?

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:39.370
Y-You're cute...

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:40.520
What?

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:41.390
What?

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:44.000
<i>What am I saying?</i>

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.330
Were you just staring at me in fascination?

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:49.400
I am ridiculously cute right now...

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.070
But we need to think seriously right now.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.000
Depending on what we do, 
we might have to camp—

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.530
S-Sorry.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.400
I don't know what's going on myself.

00:09:57.690 --> 00:10:00.990
It's just that this strange 
feeling welled up inside me,

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:02.160
and I couldn't withstand it...

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:10.170
<i>Blast it. My heart rate is 
strangely fast. What is this?</i>

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:13.920
<i>He's so cool... Jinguuji seems so cool!</i>

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:16.870
<i>Those piercing eyes and 
that always perfect hair!</i>

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:19.400
<i>His build is slender, but strong!</i>

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:22.550
<i>And now that I'm this short, I understand 
how reliable 180 cm can seem!</i>

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:25.740
<i>Even as another man, 
I've thought he was cool, but...</i>

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:27.880
<i>Those features which retain 
a hint of childlike youth!</i>

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:29.710
<i>Those dignified, intelligent blue eyes!</i>

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:32.690
<i>That translucent skin and 
glorious blonde hair!</i>

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:35.600
<i>I've never felt this sense of 
impatience before. What is it?</i>

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:37.910
<i>Why is it that I can't look away?</i>

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.200
<i>What is this?!</i>

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:46.360
For good or ill, I cast this curse which 
shall make you want to save this world!

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.210
Th-The curse!

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:50.980
<i>That blasted goddess!</i>

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:52.640
<i>She wasn't satisfied with 
turning me into a woman.</i>

00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:55.710
<i>She cast the worst, nastiest curse 
she could as a goddess of love!</i>

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.860
<i>Which means that I must withstand this</i>

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:01.090
<i>to protect our friendship!</i>

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:03.350
<i>This is bad! Insanely bad!</i>

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:06.350
<i>We must break this curse 
as quickly as possible!</i>

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:10.350
<i>In this moment, their two hearts were as one.</i>

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:13.110
Let's do this, Jinguuji.

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:17.110
Yes. We shall defeat this Demon Lord.

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:21.300
<i>Before I fall in love with this guy!</i>

00:11:21.730 --> 00:11:26.990
<i>This tale is a romantic comedy between an 
old guy and someone who used to be an old guy.</i>

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:32.000
Life with an Ordinary Guy who Reincarnated into a Total Fantasy Knockout

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:32.000
Argh

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:34.590
I hate this.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:37.030
I'm tired! I hate this! My feet hurt!

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:39.010
We haven't been hiking for even an hour.

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:40.750
Come on, try a little harder.

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:42.800
You're going to defeat the Demon Lord, right?

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:44.180
I don't feel like I can...

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:47.260
That part of your personality is 
the reason you're not popular.

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:49.520
Look at these skinny legs!

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:51.660
This body is way too weak physically!

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:54.400
And these shoes don't fit! 
They're way too big!

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:56.820
Don't go thoughtlessly showing 
your legs. It's indecent.

00:11:57.420 --> 00:12:01.480
Hey, don't you think it'd be better 
to go down the mountain than up?

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:01.990
No.

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:06.550
Climbing to the top while we can and 
checking our surroundings is the soundest choice.

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:07.330
Besides...

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:11.300
The fact that this isn't our world 
has started to set in, right?

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:13.830
What is that stupidly huge thing anyway?

00:12:14.240 --> 00:12:17.210
The plants are all things 
we've never seen before, too.

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:19.440
And it's much too quiet for a mountain.

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:22.720
Though there aren't any insects, 
there are flowers blooming. It's unsettling.

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.910
You really noticed a lot.

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:28.220
Then, do you think it'd be 
bad to drink the river water?

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:31.200
Let's hold off until our 
situation becomes critical.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:33.880
This being in another world 
thing is kinda scary.

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:36.170
I'm glad I'm with you.

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:38.360
Right? Right?

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:41.200
Still, just leaving us like this 
when we don't know anything...

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:43.190
How savage is that goddess?

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:45.740
Well, I bear responsibility in this, too.

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:48.550
There is something about this world 
which I simply cannot forgive.

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:49.240
Is that so?

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:52.280
The fact that you've become a woman.

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:53.820
Your dislike is way too focused!

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:55.940
You already knew that 
"unforgivable" thing before!

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:57.250
Yes, I did.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:13:00.120
Man...I want a bath.

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:02.760
Don't you usually start in a 
village for this kind of thing?

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:06.510
And she left us with this weird curse...

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:09.390
Is something wrong?

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:10.970
No! Nothing!

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:14.770
<i>Crap! This curse is really a problem!</i>

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:17.270
<i>Jinguuji's the same as usual.</i>

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:21.020
<i>It's like it's only me feeling weirdly 
conscious of him. It's so frustrating.</i>

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:22.440
<i>Hang on.</i>

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:27.820
<i>She did say she was using a curse, 
but she didn't say what the curse was.</i>

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:34.640
<i>Is it possible that I'm attracted
 to him regardless of the curse?</i>

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:36.460
<i>Huh? What? That's bad, right?</i>

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:40.210
Say, doesn't it seem like we've been 
cursed to fall in love with each other?

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:41.240
What?

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:43.860
<i>If I asked that, it's basically 
the same as if I said I love him.</i>

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:46.480
<i>And if the curse isn't what 
I think it is, then...</i>

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:50.100
The steadfast 25 years he 
and I have spent together...

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.720
No! That is the one thing 
that must not ever happen!

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:56.350
<i>And the fact that he seems like 
he might accept it is terrifying!</i>

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:58.850
Well, sometimes things like this happen.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:03.560
<i>And the fact that right now I might 
see that as good is also terrifying!</i>

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:05.740
<i>This situation only holds terror!</i>

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:10.870
<i>First, I have to determine whether 
Jinguuji feels attracted to me or not.</i>

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:12.870
Hey, Jinguuji...

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:16.620
You said I was cute earlier, right?

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:21.310
So this is the kind of 
thing you're into, huh?

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:23.750
No wonder you weren't interested 
in any of the women around us.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.370
I mean, there weren't any beautiful 
blonde girls like this around, right?

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:28.260
I was wondering what you were going to say.

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:32.540
Do you really think I'd ever 
praise a woman's appearance?

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:36.180
We've been together 25 years,
 and it's never happened once, has it?

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:38.640
You are as bird-brained and 
uncomprehending as ever.

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:42.650
H-Huh? Didn't you say something 
like that? How weird...

00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:46.400
<i>Crap! I'm not confident I can 
trust my memory. Is it my age?</i>

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:49.400
<i>Honestly. At a time like this...</i>

00:14:49.810 --> 00:14:53.370
<i>But I do like that part of you.</i>

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:54.410
<i>Are you asking if you're cute?</i>

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:57.160
<i>If that is what this throbbing 
in my chest says, then...</i>

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:58.920
<i>I must think you're cute!</i>

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:00.920
<i>In this state you're in, Tachibana!</i>

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:04.610
<i>Blast it! I feel like I'll go crazy
 if I look directly at her face!</i>

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:05.670
<i>But...</i>

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:08.600
<i>I have my pride.</i>

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:10.050
<i>Just you watch, Tachibana.</i>

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:14.050
<i>No matter how cute you are, 
I will never fall in love with you!</i>

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:17.610
<i>Not even if that is the type 
of curse which has been cast!</i>

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:19.310
<i>Not even though you've turned into a woman!</i>

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:23.810
<i>I will prove to that blasted goddess 
that our friendship is immutable!</i>

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:27.840
<b>Ya-y!</b>

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:27.820
<i>I will return you to being a man with 
our relationship just as it was!</i>

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:32.820
<i>This guy's expressions don't change 
much, so I can't really tell.</i>

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:36.330
<i>But without evidence, I can't do much more...</i>

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:40.330
<i>Then shouldn't I just get 
him to call me cute again?</i>

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:42.750
Oh, dear!

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:45.950
Oh, no! I've fallen down!

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:47.250
Are you all right, Tachibana?

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:49.590
Sorry, Jinguuji.

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:52.500
I don't think I can walk anymore...

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:57.960
<i>How's that? If I were a guy, I'd find 
this feminine gesture adorable...</i>

00:15:57.960 --> 00:15:59.510
<i>the upward glance!</i>

00:15:59.510 --> 00:16:03.650
<i>The only problem with it would be 
that I, at 32, am the one doing it.</i>

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:06.370
<i>This is rough! To be honest,
 it's really rough!</i>

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:06.690
<b>Ka Pow</b>

00:16:06.370 --> 00:16:06.980
<i>But!</i>

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:10.240
<i>The shock of seeing this cute move
 when I'm already so cute</i>

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:13.240
<i>should overwhelm a cerebral, four-eyed virgin!</i>

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:14.910
I see.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.410
Then...

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:18.260
I'll lend you a hand.

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:22.470
You're probably lighter than you were.

00:16:22.470 --> 00:16:24.200
Shall I carry you in a princess hold?

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:26.170
<i>H-He countered it?</i>

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:27.830
<i>That was close!</i>

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:31.090
<i>The overwhelming cuteness made me
 nearly black out for a second!</i>

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:33.480
<i>But, though it was spur of the moment, 
my reaction was good.</i>

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:36.180
<i>After rationally determining the 
advantages of the gender change,</i>

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:40.180
<i>I've thrown in some jokes to emphasize 
the fact that I'm not bothered.</i>

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:43.710
<i>Crap. I never thought he'd 
manage to evade like this!</i>

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:46.610
<i>But I've put myself through something 
really embarrassing here...</i>

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:48.940
<i>I can't retreat now!</i>

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:51.290
<i>Huh? No. Wait, wait, wait!</i>

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:55.480
<i>Are Tachibana and I about to come into 
close contact? Pressed together?!</i>

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:58.040
<i>Close contact... Piggyback would mean 
her chest pressed against my back!</i>

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:01.240
<i>A princess hold would mean our 
faces would be close together!</i>

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:03.880
<i>Fine, I'll take your challenge, Jinguuji.</i>

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:07.770
<i>Now I've come this far, pressing my chest 
against you or whatever is all the same to me!</i>

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:16.630
Huh?

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:21.350
What's with that thing?

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:22.560
It's a wild...

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:23.350
A wild... what?

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:25.060
Is it some kind of monster?

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:26.980
It's kind of cute.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.730
It's creepy! I take it back!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:37.700
What was that?

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:40.700
Jinguuji, dodge!

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:44.190
Are you okay? Did it graze you?

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:47.240
You're holding on too tight. 
Can you give me a little more slack?

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:48.250
Is this really the time?!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:51.000
I know it's gross, but 
just bear with it for now!

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:54.010
No, well... Yes.

00:17:54.390 --> 00:17:56.360
It will be harder to run 
if you loosen your grip.

00:17:56.360 --> 00:17:57.510
So hold on tight.

00:17:57.740 --> 00:17:59.470
R-Right...

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:03.220
I'm sorry. If you were alone, you'd 
have been able to get away easily.

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:04.590
It's not a problem.

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:06.730
I feel as though I've got wings.

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:08.920
That was a little creepy, you know...

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:10.230
C-Creepy?

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:13.600
I m-mean, as long as I'm not heavy, 
I guess it doesn't matter.

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:17.240
Well... More than your weight,
for me it's, how shall I put it...

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:18.990
<i>You're so soft!</i>

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:21.490
<i>And your face is so close!</i>

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:24.200
<i>No! This is no time to be 
noticing things like that!</i>

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.500
<i>I need to focus!</i>

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:26.680
<i>But...</i>

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:29.790
<i>Whether I'm conscious of it or not, 
this softness is attacking my reason...</i>

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.600
<i>She's so warm! She smells so nice!</i>

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:33.960
Oh, no!

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:39.930
Jinguuji!

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:45.150
I-I-I-It's coming! It's coming for real!

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:48.100
Please get up, Jinguuji! 
If we don't hurry up and run away...

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.600
Run? Me?

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:51.660
Jinguuji...

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:52.730
<i>That's right.</i>

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.860
<i>Why am I running in the first place?</i>

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:57.560
<i>I have never turned my 
back on an enemy and run.</i>

00:18:57.560 --> 00:19:00.860
<i>I am undefeated, unbeaten. 
I have always found a way.</i>

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:03.350
<i>Is there any need for me to run?</i>

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:08.240
Right. I'll do this. I'll do it. 
I'll do it! I will do this!

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:09.660
Hey! You idiot! Stop!

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:11.760
That thing's too dangerous, even for you!

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:12.810
It's all right.

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:14.540
I'll find a way.

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:18.300
<b>Pitter Pat</b>

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:18.300
Don't give me "pitter pat"!

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:19.830
This is seriously dangerous!

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:21.050
That thing shoots beams!

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:23.850
It's a wild exploding-type animal!

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:26.880
Come back here! You'll die!

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:29.560
Jinguuji!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:30.320
Take that.

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:35.690
<b><u>Aaaaah</u></b>

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:39.980
Is it... dead?

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:40.930
Probably.

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:44.740
Going to the gym has paid off!

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:48.340
That was beyond what you can 
do by training at the gym.

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:50.620
It's probably that thing...

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:55.850
The thing that happens in reincarnation 
stuff where physical abilities get boosted.

00:19:55.850 --> 00:19:58.170
But I do weight training every morning.

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:00.220
You think <i>that's</i> how you killed
 that with one punch?

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:04.660
The fact that you're 32 and not out of 
breath after moving that much is weird!

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:06.140
Don't lump me together with yourself.

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:07.310
Honestly.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:09.520
Dodge!

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:11.100
Huh?

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:20.780
I thought I was gonna die...

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:22.510
Jinguuji, are you okay?

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:24.440
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:26.520
I don't feel any pain in particular.

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:28.870
But there is definitely something to this.

00:20:30.990 --> 00:20:32.400
What are those numbers for?

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:33.780
Experience points?

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:35.500
Something has popped up.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:37.590
Jinguuji

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:37.590
Office Worker 

00:20:35.840 --> 00:20:37.670
Jinguuji, your level's super high!

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:39.400
And mine's super low!

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:41.380
Tachibana

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:41.380
Hero 

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:40.740
It must be because of my training!

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:41.800
Is it really thanks to that?

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:43.410
What is this "Skills" thing?

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:44.630
The way this is going...

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:46.430
Skills

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:46.470
Intelligence： 30 

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:47.360
I might have cheat-level skills!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.890
Passive

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.890
Unparalleled Beauty                       Conversation LV 1

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:52.530
Unparalleled beauty... Troublemaker...

00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:54.890
Isn't it wonderful? 
Your wishes have come true.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:58.770
I never said I wanted to be a woman.

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:00.290
Yes, you did.

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:00.980
Huh?

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:03.280
After the mixer. When you were dead drunk.

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:06.470
I want to be a girl so beautiful 
that I couldn't possibly exist

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:08.840
in this world, and have everyone fawn over me.

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:12.170
Who grants wishes from when a person's 
so drunk they don't even remember it?

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:13.790
How careless can you be?

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:15.920
Which means...

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:20.370
Could turning me into a woman have 
been a sign of that goddess's favor?

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:21.550
It probably was a kindness.

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:25.220
Didn't we complain and talk 
really harshly to her?

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:26.550
Yes, we did.

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:29.060
Next time we see her, 
we should apologize together.

00:21:29.060 --> 00:21:29.570
I refuse.

00:21:29.570 --> 00:21:30.720
We will apologize!

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:32.810
Well, if you insist, Tachibana.

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:36.080
But why is it only you who 
was given your ideal form?

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:38.160
Did I get nothing?

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:40.320
Do you have an ideal appearance?

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:41.710
Me, as I am now.

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:42.820
I see.

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:46.070
Then maybe you have skills 
or something instead?

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:49.070
You do! That's a suspicious looking one!

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:51.330
Skills

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:51.330
<u>Passive</u>                                                                <u>Active</u>

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:51.330
Since you've got it, let's try it out!

00:21:51.590 --> 00:21:53.320
It might be a cheat-level skill, after all.

00:21:53.990 --> 00:21:55.330
To activate it...

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:56.450
I do this.

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:00.820
Huh?

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:03.730
A door?

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:08.720
<b>with</b>

00:23:35.630 --> 00:23:36.850
You know...

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:37.640
What is it, Tachibana?

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:39.600
Does being 32 make us old guys?

00:23:39.600 --> 00:23:41.210
If we're not old guys, what are we?

00:23:41.210 --> 00:23:42.610
Well, that's true, but...

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Episode 2

00:23:42.610 --> 00:23:47.550
That worry only shows that you care too 
much how others and society categorize you.

00:23:47.550 --> 00:23:49.990
Your reality is something you as a member of society—

00:23:47.900 --> 00:23:49.160
I get it! Sorry.

00:23:49.160 --> 00:23:49.990
I'm good...
